  Translations:
  - Mode: 0
    p_content: "Do = A\nRe = B\nMi = C\nFa = D\nSol = E\nLa = F\nSi = G\n\nD\xE9code
      et trouve le mot cach\xE9 dans cette fr\xE9quence Rockstar! "
  - Mode: 1
    p_content: "\"Do = A\nRe = B\nMi = C\nFa = D\nSol = E\nLa = F\nSi = G\n\nD\xE9code
      Et Trouve Le Mot Cach\xE9 Dans Cette Fr\xE9quence Rockstar! \""
  - Mode: 2
    p_content: "\" !Ratskcor Ecneuq\xE9rf Ettec Snad \xC9hcac Tom El Evuort Te Edoc\xE9d\n\nG
      = Is\nF = Al\nE = Los\nD = Af\nC = Im\nB = Er\nA = Od\""
  - Mode: 3
    p_content: '"Les Roskoff m''ont donne cette liste de decodage :


      Do =
      A

      Re = B

      Mi = C

      Fa = D

      Sol = E

      La = F

      Si
      = G"'
